  "question": {
    "text": "If the domain of the function $\\log _5\\left(18 x-x^2-77\\right)$ is $(\\alpha, \\beta)$ and the domain of the function $\\log _{(x-1)}\\left(\\frac{2 x^2+3 x-2}{x^2-3 x-4}\\right)$ is $(\\gamma, \\delta)$, then $\\alpha^2+\\beta^2+\\gamma^2$ is equal to :",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "id": "5C2fG",
      "text": "195",
