  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "$\\begin{aligned} & f_1(x)=\\log _5\\left(18 x-x^2-77\\right) \\\\ & \\therefore \\quad 18 x-x^2-77>0 \\\\ & \\quad x^2-18 x+77 < 0 \\\\ & x \\in(7,11) \\\\ & \\alpha=7, \\beta=11 \\\\ & f_2(x)=\\log _{(x-1)}\\left(\\frac{2 x^2+3 x-2}{x^2-3 x-4}\\right) \\\\ & x>1, x-1 \\neq 1, \\frac{2 x^2+3 x-2}{x^2-3 x-4}>0 \\\\ & x>1, x \\neq 2, \\frac{(2 x-1)(x+2)}{(x-4)(x+1)}>0\\end{aligned}$<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/0s8b0HsjeC8CA2qvAmp2YmYP512keberVk6VgTprOVE.original.fullsize.png\"><br>\n$\\begin{aligned}\n& \\therefore \\quad x \\in(4, \\infty) \\\\\n& \\therefore \\quad \\gamma=4 \\\\\n& \\therefore \\quad \\alpha^2+\\beta^2+\\gamma^2=49+121+16 \\\\\n& =186\n\\end{aligned}$",
    "image": null
  },
